1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
This is the Wall of blacktongue.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,320
Its signature Cent, number 5185,

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,600
was struck in 1968, carries a full

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:12,640
desert patina, and is a Ghost Cent.

5
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,520
The Wall holds twenty-four Cents,

6
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,320
from 1938 to 1980.

7
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:22,160
Among them is one of only two Cents from 1938.

8
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,520
And one of nine with a full gold patina.

9
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,760
That gold, with five other Cents,

10
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,080
completes a Full Spectrum Set:

11
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,640
a full verdigris, a full obsidian,

12
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,960
a full red, a full desert,

13
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:37,360
a full gold and an orange.

14
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,160
Only nine Full Spectrum Sets can exist,

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,040
as there are only nine Full Gold Cents.

16
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,120
As of October 2026,

17
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:48,080
blacktongue is the only collector to hold one.

18
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:50,560
Across its Cents, the Wall also covers

19
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:53,120
four of the twelve contamination types,

20
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,040
which makes a Contamination Set.

21
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,760
An extraordinary Collector Wall.
